{"5430510":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Abyssal Starfeast","steam_appid":5430510,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The orders keep coming. The deep will not wait.<\/h2>Abyssal Starfeast is a first-person horror cooking simulator where you must survive seven days serving unsettling customers beneath the sea. Catch fish and prepare their meals in a cramped kitchen while the clock keeps ticking. Keeping a customer waiting can cost you more than a tip.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/extras\/9bd93738d3e97f72ce7b11f39e775ee9.avif?t=1793700429\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/extras_big\/9bd93738d3e97f72ce7b11f39e775ee9.webp?t=1793700429 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch it. Prepare it. Serve it.<\/h2>Pick up fish, ingredients, and tools and work your way through each recipe. Slice, season, grill, and simmer to complete the order, then plate your food and hand it over. Keep an eye on the grill: a moment of distraction can leave dinner burnt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/extras\/cf341916234996cacf5608eea7c38675.avif?t=1793700429\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/extras_big\/cf341916234996cacf5608eea7c38675.webp?t=1793700429 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the kitchen running. Keep yourself alive.<\/h2>Repair breaches in the hull and deal with threats that interrupt your cooking. Buy the tools and ingredients you need, manage your money and health, and decide what needs your attention first: the next dish or the latest emergency.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seven days. Different endings.<\/h2>Listen to your customers and face the unsettling events that unfold with each day. Your record of fulfilled orders and your actions at the end shape the outcome.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hands-on, first-person fishing, food preparation, cooking, and serving<br><\/li><li>Timed orders that put your planning and multitasking to the test<br><\/li><li>A tense horror atmosphere with hostile customers and kitchen emergencies<br><\/li><li>A story spanning seven days with multiple endings<br><\/li><li>English, Korean, and Japanese interfaces and subtitles<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The orders keep coming. The deep will not wait.<\/h2>Abyssal Starfeast is a first-person horror cooking simulator where you must survive seven days serving unsettling customers beneath the sea. Catch fish and prepare their meals in a cramped kitchen while the clock keeps ticking. Keeping a customer waiting can cost you more than a tip.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/extras\/9bd93738d3e97f72ce7b11f39e775ee9.avif?t=1793700429\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/extras_big\/9bd93738d3e97f72ce7b11f39e775ee9.webp?t=1793700429 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Catch it. Prepare it. Serve it.<\/h2>Pick up fish, ingredients, and tools and work your way through each recipe. Slice, season, grill, and simmer to complete the order, then plate your food and hand it over. Keep an eye on the grill: a moment of distraction can leave dinner burnt.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/extras\/cf341916234996cacf5608eea7c38675.avif?t=1793700429\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/extras_big\/cf341916234996cacf5608eea7c38675.webp?t=1793700429 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep the kitchen running. Keep yourself alive.<\/h2>Repair breaches in the hull and deal with threats that interrupt your cooking. Buy the tools and ingredients you need, manage your money and health, and decide what needs your attention first: the next dish or the latest emergency.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Seven days. Different endings.<\/h2>Listen to your customers and face the unsettling events that unfold with each day. Your record of fulfilled orders and your actions at the end shape the outcome.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Hands-on, first-person fishing, food preparation, cooking, and serving<br><\/li><li>Timed orders that put your planning and multitasking to the test<br><\/li><li>A tense horror atmosphere with hostile customers and kitchen emergencies<br><\/li><li>A story spanning seven days with multiple endings<br><\/li><li>English, Korean, and Japanese interfaces and subtitles<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Survive seven days in a sinister deep-sea kitchen. Catch, prepare, cook, and serve fish before your strange customers lose patience. A first-person horror cooking simulator where keeping up with orders is only part of staying alive.","supported_languages":"English, Japanese, Korean","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/8bd7e5a169d5d29c12f12d4331fd5664b96825cb\/header.jpg?t=1793700429","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/5d9a0c7aee4623aaaf517c0e3cee130bfe0d0357\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793700429","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/5d9a0c7aee4623aaaf517c0e3cee130bfe0d0357\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793700429","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-4460 \/ AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 2GB \/ AMD Radeon RX 560 2GB<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["AINFORGE"],"publishers":["AINFORGE"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":599,"final":539,"discount_percent":10,"initial_formatted":"$5.99","final_formatted":"$5.39"},"packages":[1874388],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Abyssal Starfeast","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1874388,"percent_savings_text":"-10% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Abyssal Starfeast - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$5.99<\/span> $5.39","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":539}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":23,"description":"Steam Cloud"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"25","description":"Adventure"},{"id":"23","description":"Indie"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/1d90ba349038f3580a062eb15beed4a821cf6c63\/ss_1d90ba349038f3580a062eb15beed4a821cf6c63.600x338.jpg?t=1793700429","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430510\/1d90ba349038f3580a062eb15beed4a821cf6c63\/ss_1d90ba349038f3580a062eb15beed4a821cf6c63.1920x1080.jpg?t=1